Subdomain SectionsAndPrograms of TeachingAndLearning
    documentation 'A school will have one or more Sections for each CourseOffering.
                  'Students are enrolled in specific Sections. Each Section will
                  'have one or more assigned Staff, will typically meet in a
                  'specific location in the school, and be assigned a ClassPeriod
                  'for the Session.
    domain item ClassPeriod
    domain item CourseOffering
    domain item EducationOrganization
    domain item Location
    domain item Program
    domain item School
    domain item Section
    domain item Session
    domain item Staff
    domain item StaffProgramAssociation
    domain item StaffSchoolAssociation
    domain item StaffSectionAssociation
    domain item Student
    domain item StudentProgramAssociation
    domain item StudentSchoolAssociation
    domain item StudentSectionAssociation
    position 2
